Booking a ride

The `Rider app` asks `Dispatch` for a car. `Dispatch` reads positions from
`Locations` and offers the ride to the `Driver app`. The `Driver app` accepts,
and `Dispatch` tells the `Rider app`.
---
Rider app -> Dispatch: request
Dispatch -> Locations: nearest cars
Dispatch -> Driver app: offer
Driver app -> Dispatch: accept
Dispatch -> Rider app: matched
